## Branching Model

| Branch | Purpose | Rules |
|---|---|---|
| `main` | Integration of new features | Changes only via pull request, 1 approval |
| `feature/*` | One branch per feature or task | Merged into `main` via pull request |
| `release/x.y` | Frozen state of a release, bug fixes only | Changes only via pull request, 1 approval, status checks must pass |

Releases are tagged `vX.Y.Z` (e.g. `v1.0.0`) and built automatically by the release pipeline.